Short:        AmiBlitz 2.42 full distribution
Author:       Acidsoft /Red When Excited /berndroesch1@compuserve.de
Uploader:     Cj-Stroker web de
Type:         dev/blitz
Version:      2.42
Replaces:     All older Versions
Requires:     http://www.amiforce.de
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Distribution: Aminet

*** Important, for updates check: http://www.david-mcminn.co.uk/bernd ***

This is version 2.42 of AmiBlitz, BlitzBasic "gpl`ed". It is a stable release,
but not the most recent. The most recent version can be downloaded from the 
site mentioned above. There is documentation in this archive describing 
everything and it can be installed using the installer script.

For lots of Blitz related material(source code, documentation etc.) check
http://www.blitz-2000.co.uk and http://www.amiforce.de
